--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *The full `fwdL` / `exactConvL` programs, part 9: `fwdLP`*: `fwdLP fw = S̃ phase (loop over the axes, `sapAxP` per axis); ftlP fw; B̃ phase (loop over the
